## Wave 4 — median            <!-- status: pending -->
- [ ] Add `median(values: number[]): number` to `src/num.ts`: the middle value, the mean of the two middle values for an even count, `NaN` for an empty list.
- [ ] Add tests for it to `src/num.test.ts` (odd count, even count, unsorted input, empty list).
- [ ] Run `make check`, commit, update this plan (this wave `done`, Left behind "chain complete"), commit, push. Spawn nothing.
